re to lend a hand. It's great to fuel your ideas. Remember that photo you sent me once? Love how this guitar shows our different artistic styles.\n/memories/session-16.md:L52: [Image caption: a photo of a guitar with a octopus on it]\n/memories/session-16.md:L58: Dave: That's a great guitar, Calvin! Love the design, it's so unique and special.\n/memories/session-16.md:L61: Calvin: Cheers, mate! Really appreciate it. This guitar means so much to me; it's a reminder of my passion for music and the amazing friendships I've made.\n/memories/session-16.md:L68: [Image caption: a photo of a guitar with a purple glow on it]\n/memories/session-16.md:L71: Dave: That guitar has a gorgeous purple hue. Why did you make it so shiny?\n/memories/session-25.md:L83: [Image caption: a photo of a brown amp with a black knob and a brown cover]\n/memories/session-28.md:L88: [Image caption: a photography of a guitar logo with the company band logo]","content_sha256":"a8ec685654e12b21dad217c56dcad9229161327ad914bbf48d0fa3dce808e6ea","coverage":[{"line_end":49,"line_start":49,"path":"/memories/session-02.md"},{"line_end":18,"line_start":18,"path":"/memories/session-06.md"},{"line_end":21,"line_start":21,"path":"/memories/session-06.md"},{"line_end":68,"line_start":68,"path":"/memories/session-09.md"},{"line_end":72,"line_start":72,"path":"/memories/session-09.md"},{"line_end":51,"line_start":51,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":52,"line_start":52,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":58,"line_start":58,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":61,"line_start":61,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":68,"line_start":68,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":71,"line_start":71,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":83,"line_start":83,"path":"/memories/session-25.md"},{"line_end":88,"line_start":88,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23